          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inicio"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you’d rather wait, it installs automatically the next time you quit the app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si prefieres esperar, se instala sola la próxima vez que cierres la app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install it on this Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Instalarlo en esta Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installed on this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Instalado en esta Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installing Paperclip with its official command. When it’s done, it keeps running in this window.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Instalando Paperclip con su comando oficial. Al terminar queda encendido en esta ventana."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installing in Terminal": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Instalando en la Terminal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install…": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Instalar…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It answered with error %lld: Paperclip may be off behind it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Respondió con un error %lld: Paperclip puede estar apagado detrás."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It can be up to %lld characters; yours has %lld. Write it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Puede tener hasta %lld caracteres; el tuyo tiene %lld. Escríbelo de nuevo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It didn’t respond in time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No contestó a tiempo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It has to be more than what was already spent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tiene que ser más que lo ya gastado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It installs in Terminal": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se instala en la Terminal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It installs when you restart or quit the app": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se instala cuando reinicias o cierras la app"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It isn’t accepting connections: Paperclip may not be running.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No acepta conexiones: Paperclip puede estar apagado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It isn’t responding. Check the address and that Paperclip is running.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No responde. Revisa la dirección y que Paperclip esté encendido."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It no longer exists in Paperclip.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ya no existe en Paperclip."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It responds, but it isn’t Paperclip.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Responde, pero no es Paperclip."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It starts in a Terminal window, which has to stay open.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se enciende en una ventana de la Terminal, que tiene que quedar abierta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It starts with its service, without opening anything.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se enciende con su servicio, sin abrir nada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It was no longer pending in Paperclip: I didn’t change anything.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ya no estaba pendiente en Paperclip: no cambié nada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It went to %@, but Paperclip didn’t wake it up, and the app’s automatic wake-up didn’t work either.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pasó a %@, pero Paperclip no lo despertó, y el despertar automático de la app tampoco funcionó."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It went to %@, but the app couldn’t check whether it’s on its way: Paperclip’s answer couldn’t be read. Check the task in Paperclip.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pasó a %@, pero la app no pudo comprobar si va en camino: no pudo leer lo que contestó Paperclip. Revisa la tarea en Paperclip."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It went to an agent, but Paperclip didn’t wake it up, and the app’s automatic wake-up didn’t work either.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pasó a un agente, pero Paperclip no lo despertó, y el despertar automático de la app tampoco funcionó."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its limit is %@. The count resets %@, and until then anything you ask of it won’t run.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Su tope es de %1$@. La cuenta se reinicia %2$@, y hasta entonces lo que se le pida no va a correr."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its token is deleted from the Keychain and it stops sending you decisions. To use it again, you’ll have to connect it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se borra su token del llavero y deja de mandarte las decisiones. Para volver, hay que conectarlo de nuevo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It’s always in Settings → Telegram.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Siempre está en Ajustes → Telegram."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It’s answered on the Paperclip page.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se contesta en la página de Paperclip."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It’s answered step by step in Telegram, and everything is sent together at the end:": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se contesta paso a paso en Telegram y todo se manda junto al final:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It’s free and open source. It installs with its official command and needs Node.js.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es gratis y de código abierto. Se instala con su comando oficial; necesita Node.js."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It’s now on %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ya está en la %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It’s on by default because it’s a known Paperclip bug: without it, those tasks wait until someone notices. It only looks at handoffs it sees while it’s open and works quietly; only if the wake-up fails do you get the stuck-task notification with its button. It will go away once Paperclip fixes the bug.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Viene activado porque es un bug conocido de Paperclip: sin esto, esas tareas esperan hasta que alguien se dé cuenta. Solo mira los traspasos que ve pasar mientras está abierta y trabaja en silencio; solo si el despertar falla te llega el aviso de la tarea trabada con su botón. Desaparecerá cuando Paperclip arregle el bug."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It’s served on the studio Mac: check the animations on your phone before approving.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Está servida en la Mac del estudio: mira las animaciones en tu teléfono antes de aprobarla."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It’s served on the studio Mac: open it on your phone and tell me if the steps feel too long.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Está servida en la Mac del estudio: ábrela en tu teléfono y dime si los pasos se hacen muy largos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It’s the official command, with Node.js %@. It sets up local mode: only on this Mac and with no password. When it’s done, Paperclip keeps running in that window and this continues on its own.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es su comando oficial, con Node.js %@. Queda en modo local: solo en esta Mac y sin contraseña. Al terminar, Paperclip queda encendido en esa ventana y aquí se sigue solo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It’s waiting for your approval.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Espera tu aprobación."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It’s waiting for your review.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Espera tu revisión."
          }
        }
      }
